ate a minimalist editorial frame.\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"obj\",\"bbox\":[100,100,830,900],\"desc\":\"Close-up of a medieval knight from the chest up alongside his barded warhorse, presented as a classical stone sculpture. The figure features completely desaturated, monochromatic matte grey tones with realistic dust textures and deep, high-contrast shadows defining the plates of armor and the grip on a large vertical broadsword.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[850,50,950,950],\"text\":\"COMFYUI\",\"desc\":\"Large, elegant high-end serif display typography with thin sweeping ligatures spanning the lower portion of the frame in a solid clean white, mirroring the typography style of image_0f5a20.png.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[40,50,90,350],\"text\":\"LATENT_GEN // K_SAMPLER\",\"desc\":\"Small white technical sans-serif text in a clean monospace font located in the top-left corner within the border grid.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[40,680,90,950],\"text\":\"QUEUE_PROMPT_STATE: 1\",\"desc\":\"Small white data readout text in a monospace font positioned in the top-right corner within the layout line.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[400,30,600,150],\"text\":\"NODE MODULES\\n> load_checkpoint\\n> positive_prompt\\n> negative_prompt\",\"desc\":\"A left-aligned vertical block of small white technical data text on the middle-left margin.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[400,850,600,970],\"text\":\"SAMPLER FIELDS\\n> steps: 30\\n> denoise: 0.75\\n> seed: 407231\",\"desc\":\"A right-aligned vertical block of small white parameter configuration text on the middle-right margin.\"},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"bbox\":[960,460,985,540],\"desc\":\"A small, clean white horizontal graphic barcode element centered precisely along the absolute bottom edge.\"}]}}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 347, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, 